:"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"76394","synopsis":"One day, a youth named Akina Myodo from Kanazawa of Kaga obtains a mysterious card after experiencing a vision of planet Cray. That card is proof that he has been chosen as the Fated One of Miracles, and an invitation to the \"Fated Clash\", where the last one standing can have their wish granted."},{"title":"Fated Clash","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"76497","synopsis":"With the knowledge that Hikari's illness may be cured if he is the last one standing in the \"Fated Clash\", Akina gains a sense for Vanguard under the tutelage of Nao, his senior from his part-time job. However, as if his line of thinking was foreseen, Gabwelius appears before Akina once more."},{"title":"Unparalleled and Miracles","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"76592","synopsis":"First round of the Fated Clash is set at the spiritual ground, Hakusan. The Fated Ones facing off are Unparalleled vs. Miracles. A sudden match between the apprentice and the master, Akina and Nao. Nao exhibits unparalleled strength, aiming to be a pro-fighter. Does Akina stand a chance?"},{"title":"An Idol`s Afternoon","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"76760","synopsis":"The perfect idol Mikoto is currently on hiatus and hooked on Net Vanguard. Joining an offline meeting, Akina witnesses the fight between Megumi and Mikoto. Meanwhile, the masked person comes into contact with Suo Yobitsugi."},{"title":"The Guiding Star of Ever-changing","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"76913","synopsis":"It's the second round of the Fated Clash, and for some reason, Mikoto's opponent Taizo Kiyokura knows about Akina, and even visits Hikari in hospital. The fight begins, and while Taizo praises Mikoto's effort, he also remarks that he \"can't see her self in her fights\"."},{"title":"Reckless Wings","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"77134","synopsis":"Akina faces off against Taizo in the third round of the Fated Clash. Taizo's confidence remains unshaken despite his consecutive battles, as giving his best at all times is his style as a pro-fighter. Recognizing the difference in skill, Akina bets on the \"one in a hundred\" chance and fights with all his might."},{"title":"Towards the Stormy Day","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77772","synopsis":"The quiet and emotionless boy Suo Yobitsugi shares with Akina about his painful past as the pair pass a stormy night in town. Meanwhile, as Masanori starts questioning Gabwelius about the true aim of the Fated Clash, Shinobu appears to challenge him to a showdown."},{"title":"Maiden`s Reverie","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77917","synopsis":"Nao participates in the \"Rising Dragon Cup\" Vanguard tournament. Her opponent Mondo Kirishima is a powerful pro-fighter who made a comeback to show his son how fights should be done, but Nao is giving it her all as well. Who will emerge victorious?!"},{"title":"Taboo Upon Zero","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"78095","synopsis":"It is the third round of the Fated Clash, with Suo standing on the Hakusan stage. Masanori attempts to bewilder his opponent, but Suo remains unfazed. An unexpected development occurs in the fight between Zero and Taboo. What exactly does Suo desire from the Fated Clash?"},{"title":"The Seventh Wish","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"78227","synopsis":"The shocking revelation of the true identity of the masked person. The reason for her various actions in the Fated Clash, as well as the mystery of the supposedly nonexistent \"Seventh Fated One,\" are now unveiled. If the final clash were to take place, all that awaits is destruction. What decision will Akina make with this knowledge?"},{"title":"Siblings","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":16,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18248","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164204","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"54142","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"35442","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"245821","scope":"s16","seasonNumber":16,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"78432","synopsis":"Will it be Akina or Hikari who changes fate? Their resolves clash right before t